"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/frame()":{"title":"frame()","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/frame()","abstract":[],"type":"topic","deprecated":true,"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/frame()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"frame","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}